  "period_note": "Year-end (31 December 2012) position from Islami Bank Bangladesh's own audited annual report 'Five Years Performance' table, taken from the FY2012 report (the reporting year's own document). SOLO / STANDALONE basis. Islami Bank Bangladesh is a Shariah-compliant bank, so its own terminology is used in original_metric_name: 'Investment' is the financing book (the equivalent of loans and advances), 'Investment Income' is the equivalent of interest income, and 'Profit Paid on deposit' is the equivalent of interest expense. The normalised metric names map these onto the dataset's conventional banking vocabulary: gross_loans holds General Investment, net_interest_income holds Net Investment Income, and classified_loans holds Classified Investment. Total liabilities are calculated as total assets (excluding contra) minus shareholders' equity; the source table does not print a total-liabilities line. total_assets is the balance-sheet total EXCLUDING contra items, which is the comparable figure for other banks in this dataset; the bank's own 'Total Assets (including Contra)' is retained separately as total_assets_incl_contra and is materially larger. In the FY2012-format table, Reserve Fund already subsumes retained earnings: paid-up capital plus reserve fund reproduces shareholders' equity exactly for both FY2011 and FY2012, so the separate retained-earnings row in that report is not additive and is deliberately not carried into this record. EPS is not printed in the FY2012 report and is taken from the FY2014 report (4.42). RESTATEMENTS -- 14 figure(s) in this record are reported differently by other Islami Bank annual reports. Per this dataset's sourcing rule the contemporaneous value is kept and the divergence recorded here: reserve_fund: this record uses 27245.9 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2015/AR2016 report 24116.5; retained_earnings: this record uses 3127.41 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 3152.25; total_investment: this record uses 372921 (AR2012); AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 399931, 406817; provision_classified: this record uses 3935.9 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 6054.35; provision_unclassified: this record uses 1100.45 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2015/AR2016 report 3935.9; provision_off_bs: this record uses 43672.2 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 1100.45; non_investment_income: this record uses 6673.54 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 6345.56; gross_income: this record uses 50345.8 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 50017.8; operating_expenses: this record uses 8867.1 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 8724.65; provision_charge: this record uses 3512.07 (AR2012); AR2015 report 8724.65; profit_before_tax: this record uses 12096.2 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 11910.6; profit_after_tax: this record uses 5524.44 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 5338.91; nav_per_share: this record uses 31.78 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 27.18; roe_pct: this record uses 13.9 (AR2012); AR2013/AR2014/AR2015/AR2016 report 13.42.",
